sequenceDiagram
  actor Wr as Writer
  actor Rv as Reviewer
  participant C as ScriptController
  participant S as ScriptService
  participant H as StatusHistoryService
  participant V as ScriptVersionRepository
  Wr->>C: POST /scripts/{id}/submit-review
  C->>S: submitForReview(id, writer)
  S->>S: DRAFT or CHANGE_REQUESTED, at least 1 scene
  S->>H: record(DRAFT to IN_REVIEW)
  S-->>C: IN_REVIEW, version frozen
  alt approve
    Rv->>C: POST /scripts/{id}/approve
    C->>S: approve(id, note, reviewer)
    S->>H: recordReview(SCRIPT, APPROVED)
  else request changes
    Rv->>C: POST /scripts/{id}/request-changes (note)
    C->>S: requestChanges(id, note, reviewer)
    S->>S: requireReason(note)
    S->>V: save new draft version (revision 0)
    S->>H: recordReview(SCRIPT, REJECTED, reason)
  end
